      "end": 292.98,
      "text": "And then down here,"
    },
    {
      "start": 292.98,
      "end": 294.26,
      "text": "we have some additional resources."
    },
    {
      "start": 294.26,
      "end": 295.02,
      "text": "So we have learning"
    },
    {
      "start": 295.02,
      "end": 295.82,
      "text": "more about copywriting."
    },
    {
      "start": 295.92,
      "end": 296.8,
      "text": "We've got Harry's website,"
    },
    {
      "start": 297.22,
      "end": 298.28,
      "text": "some famous campaigns."
    },
    {
      "start": 298.36,
      "end": 299.22,
      "text": "I'm going to add some more stuff"
    },
    {
      "start": 299.22,
      "end": 300.14,
      "text": "in here for you guys as well."
    },
    {
      "start": 300.34,
      "end": 301.0,
      "text": "And then we have,"
    },
    {
      "start": 301.0,
      "end": 302.48,
      "text": "of course, Eugene's Headlines,"
    },
    {
      "start": 302.58,
      "end": 304.08,
      "text": "which is the 38 headlines"
    },
    {
      "start": 304.08,
      "end": 305.28,
      "text": "from Breakthrough Advertising"
    },
    {
      "start": 305.28,
      "end": 306.44,
      "text": "that you guys can see here."
    },
    {
      "start": 306.44,
      "end": 307.86,
      "text": "And then what I have down here"
    },
    {
      "start": 307.86,
      "end": 308.86,
      "text": "is a dot, dot, dot"
    },
    {
      "start": 308.86,
      "end": 309.98,
      "text": "and a garbage bin."
    },
    {
      "start": 310.3,
      "end": 311.7,
      "text": "So what you guys are going to see"
    },
    {
      "start": 311.7,
      "end": 313.42,
      "text": "is I'm going to start"
    },
    {
      "start": 313.42,
      "end": 314.9,
      "text": "to be filming myself"
    },
    {
      "start": 314.9,
      "end": 316.82,
      "text": "actually writing some of these ads"
    },
    {
      "start": 316.82,
      "end": 317.68,
      "text": "and working towards"
    },
    {
      "start": 317.68,
      "end": 319.6,
      "text": "actually writing winning ads"
    },
    {
      "start": 319.6,
      "end": 320.22,
      "text": "for our brands."
    },
    {
      "start": 320.32,
      "end": 321.04,
      "text": "I want you guys to know"
    },
    {
      "start": 321.04,
      "end": 322.04,
      "text": "that myself as the agency owner,"
    },
    {
      "start": 322.2,
      "end": 322.38,
      "text": "you know,"
    },
    {
      "start": 322.44,
      "end": 323.68,
      "text": "I obviously am not writing ads"
    },
    {
      "start": 323.68,
      "end": 324.52,
      "text": "every single day for our clients,"
    },
    {
      "start": 324.52,
      "end": 325.72,
      "text": "but I have jumped back"
    },
    {
      "start": 325.72,
      "end": 326.3,
      "text": "into the saddle."
    },
    {
      "start": 326.62,
      "end": 327.54,
      "text": "I've been writing ads"
    },
    {
      "start": 327.54,
      "end": 328.48,
      "text": "basically every day"
    },
    {
      "start": 328.48,
      "end": 329.5,
      "text": "and I've already started"
    },
    {
      "start": 329.5,
      "end": 330.48,
      "text": "to hit top spenders"
    },
    {
      "start": 330.48,
      "end": 331.18,
      "text": "for our brands."
    },
    {
      "start": 331.36,
      "end": 332.62,
      "text": "And I want to kind of"
    },
    {
      "start": 332.62,
      "end": 334.1,
      "text": "basically show you guys"
    },
    {
      "start": 334.1,
      "end": 335.8,
      "text": "through how I'm applying"
    },
    {
      "start": 335.8,
      "end": 336.42,
      "text": "this process"
    },
    {
      "start": 336.42,
      "end": 337.38,
      "text": "because I know a lot of you guys"
    },
    {
      "start": 337.38,
      "end": 338.78,
      "text": "want to watch me do it as well."
    },
    {
      "start": 338.84,
      "end": 339.48,
      "text": "You don't just want to hear me"
    },
    {
      "start": 339.48,
      "end": 340.26,
      "text": "tell you what to do."
    },
    {
      "start": 340.36,
      "end": 342.02,
      "text": "And so that is the next phase of this."
    },
    {
      "start": 342.12,
      "end": 343.16,
      "text": "I know so many of you guys"
    },
    {
      "start": 343.16,
      "end": 344.3,
      "text": "have been looking forward to this"
    },
    {
      "start": 344.3,
      "end": 345.92,
      "text": "and I know that a lot of you"
    },
    {
      "start": 345.92,
      "end": 347.24,
      "text": "who are in Evolve"
    },
    {
      "start": 347.24,
      "end": 348.38,
      "text": "currently have been staying in here"
    },
    {
      "start": 348.38,
      "end": 349.06,
      "text": "just for this."
    },
    {
      "start": 349.4,
      "end": 350.28,
      "text": "And I want to let you know"
    },
    {
      "start": 350.28,
      "end": 350.98,
      "text": "that I have put everything"
    },
    {
      "start": 350.98,
      "end": 351.78,
      "text": "I have into this."
    },
    {
      "start": 351.88,
      "end": 353.98,
      "text": "My hand actually like hurts."
    },
    {
      "start": 354.06,
      "end": 355.68,
      "text": "Like I actually can't use my hand."
    },
    {
      "start": 355.74,
      "end": 356.96,
      "text": "I actually have a few more videos"
    },
    {
      "start": 356.96,
      "end": 357.26,
      "text": "to edit"
    },
    {
      "start": 357.26,
      "end": 358.44,
      "text": "and like I'm telling you guys"
    },
    {
      "start": 358.44,
      "end": 359.24,
      "text": "I'm a little bit worried"
    },
    {
      "start": 359.24,
      "end": 360.04,
      "text": "about my hand"
    },
    {
      "start": 360.04,
      "end": 361.34,
      "text": "and like getting carpal tunnel."
    },
    {
      "start": 361.44,
      "end": 362.0,
      "text": "Like that's how much"
    },
    {
      "start": 362.0,
      "end": 362.5,
      "text": "I've been working."
    },
    {
      "start": 362.68,
      "end": 363.92,
      "text": "And so I've basically"
    },
    {
      "start": 363.92,
      "end": 365.22,
      "text": "gone off the grid from my team."
    },
    {
      "start": 365.3,
      "end": 365.86,
      "text": "I've been talking to my team"
    },
    {
      "start": 365.86,
      "end": 366.4,
      "text": "like once a week"
    },
    {
      "start": 366.4,
      "end": 367.36,
      "text": "and I've just been focusing"
    },
    {
      "start": 367.36,
      "end": 368.3,
      "text": "on nothing but this."
    },
    {
      "start": 368.6,
      "end": 369.66,
      "text": "And so I'm very excited"
    },
    {
      "start": 369.66,
      "end": 370.7,
      "text": "for you guys to go through this."
    },
    {
      "start": 371.0,
      "end": 371.68,
      "text": "Obviously there's going to be"
    },
    {
      "start": 371.68,
      "end": 372.58,
      "text": "some more stuff to come"
    },
    {
      "start": 372.58,
      "end": 373.9,
      "text": "but I'm not going to set"
    },
    {
      "start": 373.9,
      "end": 374.9,
      "text": "any timeline on that."
    },
    {
      "start": 374.96,
      "end": 375.6,
      "text": "That's going to happen"
    },
    {
      "start": 375.6,
      "end": 376.38,
      "text": "when it happens"
    },
    {
      "start": 376.38,
      "end": 377.76,
      "text": "and you guys will see that"
    },
    {
      "start": 377.76,
      "end": 378.74,
      "text": "start to come your way."
    },
    {
      "start": 378.92,
      "end": 379.94,
      "text": "So with that said"
    },
    {
      "start": 379.94,
      "end": 381.8,
      "text": "I hope that you guys enjoy this."
    },
    {
      "start": 381.9,
      "end": 382.48,
      "text": "I hope that you get"
    },
    {
      "start": 382.48,
      "end": 383.06,
      "text": "a ton of value"
    },
    {
      "start": 383.06,
      "end": 383.96,
      "text": "and I'm so excited"
    },
    {
      "start": 383.96,
      "end": 385.08,
      "text": "for you guys to go through this"
    },
    {
      "start": 385.08,
      "end": 386.04,
      "text": "and see how it can"
    },
    {
      "start": 386.04,
      "end": 386.78,
      "text": "impact your business."
    }
  ]
}
